German Special Forces at Hostage
The Egyptian government has sought help from Germany to resolve the hostage crisis – and experts have come.
When the situation became trejooth, the special units were ready, but they did not take action.
More and more details about the release of the eleven European tourists kidnapped in Egypt are coming to light.
